.TH ncurses 3X 2026-09-19 "ncurses @NCURSES_MAJOR@.@NCURSES_MINOR@" "Library calls"
.ie \n(.g \{\
.ds `` \(lq
.ds '' \(rq
.\}
.el \{\
.ie t .ds `` ``
.el   .ds `` ""
.ie t .ds '' ''
.el   .ds '' ""
.\}
.
.de bP
.ie n  .IP \(bu 4
.el    .IP \(bu 2
..
.
.\" Add supplementary paragraph tag on its own line after TP.
.\" Adapted from TQ (which would produce mandoc warnings).
.de tQ
.  br
.  ns
.  TP
..
.
